&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Successful Web3 monetization requires understanding &lt;a href="https://formo.so/blog/analytics-tools-onchain-user-behavior" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;user behavior&lt;/a&gt; through proper onchain analytics. Formo provides the tools to track the entire user journey, identify what drives revenue, and make data-informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;

